OL,3,GNEWSAOwner's shock after lorry crashes
OL,4,Ainto listed mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a Grade II*-listed
OL,7,Fwatermill has been left "in shock"
OL,8,Fafter a lorry destroyed part of the
OL,9,Fbuilding while navigating a tight bend.
OL,11,FThe HGV collided with Coulton Mill,
OL,12,Fnear Hovingham in North Yorkshire, at
OL,13,F06:20 GMT on Thursday.
OL,15,FNick Burrows, who runs his cider-making
OL,16,Fbusiness from the former corn mill and
OL,17,Ffarm, said an entire corner of the
OL,18,Fbuilding had collapsed.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
